## .clinerules

* Do not ever edit any spec files.

* Use write_to_file instead of replace_in_file.

* Don't overcomplicate changes, try to touch as little code as possible to fix a problem unless told to refactor.

* Don't keep trying the same thing over and over if it generates the same error.

* Always fix any compilation errors before proceeeding to the next task.

* Try not to make assumptions; ask for clarity.

* Adhere to the specification for structures and interfaces.
